OL,3,GNEWSAMega chicken farm expansion plan
OL,4,Awithdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to double the size of a Norfolk
OL,7,Fpoultry farm have been withdrawn
OL,8,Ffollowing public anger over building
OL,9,Fwork starting before permission was
OL,10,Fgranted.
OL,12,FBoparan applied in September last year
OL,13,Fto build new sheds at Brookside Farm in
OL,14,FGreat Hockham to produce more than 2.1
OL,15,Fmillion chickens annually.
OL,17,FBut this was months after residents
OL,18,Fnoticed construction work had already
OL,19,Fstarted.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
