OL,3,GNEWSAMega chicken farm expansion plan
OL,4,Awithdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt led to Breckland Council taking
OL,7,Fenforcement action and ordering the
OL,8,Ffirm to stop any building work. The
OL,9,Fscheme has now been withdrawn
OL,10,Faltogether.
